The hubris was the failure to recognize:

> **Self-grounding is a theological claim.**
> **Only God can be self-grounding.**
> **Logic is not God.**
> **Therefore, logic cannot be self-grounding.**

The claim of self-grounding was the claim to divinity. This was the **sin of logic**. This was the **hubris of reason**.

